English Version

MovieClaw is licensed under a modified version of the Apache License 2.0 (full
text below), with the following additional conditions. Where these conditions
conflict with the Apache License 2.0, these conditions prevail.

1. Free Use

Subject to this license, you may use this software free of charge for
non-commercial purposes, and modify it for those purposes:
  a. personal or household use, including self-hosting on your own devices or
     on servers you rent yourself;
  b. non-profit sharing with family members and friends;
  c. study, research and teaching.

2. Commercial Use Requires Written Authorization

Without prior written authorization from the copyright holder, you may not use
this software, its modified versions or derivative works for any commercial
purpose, including but not limited to:
  a. providing this software or its functionality to third parties (other than
     those described in 1.b) in any form, including SaaS, cloud services,
     hosting or multi-tenant services, whether paid or free;
  b. selling, renting or reselling this software, its modified versions or
     derivative works, or pre-installing or bundling them with any paid
     hardware (including NAS devices), firmware, software or service;
  c. offering paid deployment, installation or managed-operation services for
     this software, or offering it as a benefit of a paid membership or paid
     community;
  d. use by companies or other for-profit organizations in their business
     activities, including internal use;
  e. any other use intended to obtain direct or indirect economic benefit.

3. Redistribution

You may distribute this software or its modified versions on a non-commercial
basis, provided that:
  a. you include the full text of this license and retain all copyright,
     patent, trademark and attribution notices;
  b. modified versions carry prominent notices stating what was changed;
  c. modified versions and derivative works remain under this license; you may
     not relicense them under other terms, nor remove or weaken these
     additional conditions.

4. Contributions

By submitting a contribution (including code, documentation or translations)
to this project, you represent that you have the right to submit it, and you
agree that:
  a. the copyright holder may change the license of this project;
  b. the copyright holder may use your contribution for commercial purposes,
     including granting commercial licenses to third parties.

5. Earlier Versions

Versions up to and including v0.27.0 were released under the MIT License and
remain under it. This license applies to versions released after v0.27.0.

6. Miscellaneous
  a. For commercial licensing, contact the copyright holder via
     https://github.com/movieclaw/movieclaw.
  b. Third-party components included in this software remain under their own
     licenses.
  c. This license is governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China.
     In case of any discrepancy between the Chinese and English versions, the
     Chinese version prevails.

